flowchart TD
    Client[User / API Client] --> API[app.py - FastAPI routes]
    API --> Models[models.py - Pydantic validation]
    API --> Services[services.py - application logic]
    Services --> Repository[repository.py - SQL queries]
    Repository --> Database[database.py - SQLite connections]
    Database --> SQLite[(inventory.db)]
    Startup[app startup] --> Migration[migrate.py - CSV import]
    Migration --> Repository
    Backup[backup.py - backup sidecar] --> SQLite
    Backup --> Backups[(backup volume)]
    CSV[(data/inventory.csv)] --> Migration
